  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll Help Guide\n\n### How to download your client&#39;s PAYE details\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 14 Sep, 2021 at  2:28 PM\n\n\t\tLocation:\n\nPayroll Dashboard >> 'PAYE Clients' >> Download button\n\nHelp Guide:\n\nAs seen below, you can download a list of all PAYE clients. This will be downloaded as a CSV and will include the following:\n\n1. Client ID2. Client Email ID3. Phone Number4. Company Type5. Client Name6. HMRC office number7. PAYE reference Number8. Accounts office Number9. Client Status – Active / Inactive\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
